   "columns": [
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<h3>ZOLLER Automation Solutions do some things differently and many things better. They take the efficiency of tool processes to the extreme.</h3>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c2271",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<p><strong>ZOLLER Automation Solutions automate all tool-related processes. From the assistance robot on the presetting and measuring machine to the new »coraMeasure LG« gantry solution and complete automation of the store floor, including machine loading, everything is possible with ZOLLER. Build your smart factory step by step now.</strong></p> <p>Automation increases efficiency. It relieves skilled workers during tool assembly or tool transport to the CNC machine. It reduces costs, keeps tools available and increases productivity. </p> <p>With ZOLLER Automation Solutions, you can automate flexibly. All solutions interlock and the entire production level with all CNC machines is taken into account.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/in/products/automation\">Show products</a></p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c2270",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ]
   ],
   "ftype": "container-2cols",
   "id": "c2272",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {
    "before": "extra-small",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "quotes",
   "header": "",
   "slides": [
    {
     "img": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/8/5/csm_toolBalancer_Alexander_Zoller2_7bc76f629f.webp",
      "alt": ""
     },
     "text": "<p class=\"extra-large-text\">It is high time to modernize the provision of tools in manufacturing processes. The modular ZOLLER automation concept opens up the path to the smart factory for every production facility.</p> <p><strong>Alexander Zoller, Managing Director</strong></p>",
     "right": true,
     "quote": true,
     "dark": true
    },
    {
     "img": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/2/7/csm_toolBalancer_Christoph_Zoller2_490ea1f2a5.webp",
      "alt": ""
     },
     "text": "<p class=\"extra-large-text\">ZOLLER Automation Solutions are your logical next step. Increase the efficiency of your production with innovative technologies.</p> <p><strong>Christoph Zoller, Managing Director</strong></p>",
     "right": false,
     "quote": true,
     "dark": true
    }
   ],
   "ftype": "zoller_slider-full-width",
