   "bg": "",
   "space": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> A head start through greater efficiency </h2>",
   "body": "<p><strong>The productivity of many production facilities is falling because highly trained employees have to carry out standard tasks. If you automate tool assembly, picking and transportation with ZOLLER Automation Solutions, you can reduce this cost-intensive time expenditure.</strong></p> <p>Make optimum use of your skilled workers' available time. Make productive use of your experts by utilizing their knowledge and experience where it is indispensable. Your production productivity and profits will increase.</p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/b/1/csm_kosteneffizienz_einzel_en_01_a17aa14a5e.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1097,
     "h": 1097
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
